{"edits": [{"op": "replace", "segment": 4, "text": "1. The Discloser intends to disclose information (the Confidential Information) to the Recipient solely for the purpose of recommendation of future land use of the decommissioned play area on Ship Street (the Purpose), and for no other land, planning or project work.", "fixes": "S-028"}, {"op": "replace", "segment": 6, "text": "3. The Recipient undertakes to keep the Confidential Information secure and not to disclose it to any third party, except that it may disclose it to its employees, advisers, auditors and subcontractors who need it for the Purpose and who are bound by obligations of confidence no less protective than this Agreement.", "fixes": "P-17, P-18"}, {"op": "replace", "segment": 8, "text": "a) any information which is or in future comes into the public domain other than as a result of any breach of this Agreement by the Recipient or any person to whom the Recipient disclosed it; or", "fixes": "S-025"}, {"op": "replace", "segment": 9, "text": "b) any information which the Recipient can demonstrate by written evidence was already known to the Recipient and which was not subject to any obligation of confidence before it was disclosed to the Recipient by the Discloser; or
c) any information which the Recipient may acquire lawfully from an independent third party without breaching this Agreement, where such information is similar to the Confidential Information.", "fixes": "S-024, P-27"}, {"op": "replace", "segment": 10, "text": "5. Nothing in this Agreement will prevent the Recipient from making any disclosure of the Confidential Information required by law, regulation or judicial process or by any competent authority, provided that the Recipient gives the Discloser prompt written notice before any such disclosure (to the extent legally permitted), discloses only what it is legally required to disclose, and seeks confidential treatment where available.", "fixes": "P-04, S-026"}, {"op": "replace", "segment": 11, "text": "6. The Recipient will, on the earlier of completion of the Purpose and request from the Discloser, return or destroy all copies and records of the Confidential Information and will not retain any copies or records of the Confidential Information.", "fixes": "S-027"}, {"op": "replace", "segment": 12, "text": "7. Neither this Agreement nor the supply of any information grants the Recipient any licence, ownership interest or other right in respect of the Confidential Information or any intellectual property rights of the Discloser.", "fixes": "P-05"}, {"op": "replace", "segment": 13, "text": "8. The undertakings in clauses 2 and 3 will continue in force for sixty (60) months from the date of this Agreement.", "fixes": "P-11, P-12"}, {"op": "insert_after", "segment": 13, "text": "The Recipient shall not disclose to any person the fact that the Parties have negotiated or entered into this Agreement.

The Discloser shall be entitled to seek injunctive or other equitable relief to prevent or restrain any actual or threatened breach of this Agreement, in addition to any other remedy available at law or in equity.", "fixes": "P-08, RISK-REMEDY"}, {"op": "replace", "segment": 14, "text": "9. This Agreement is governed by, and is to be construed in accordance with, Delaware law.", "fixes": "P-22"}, {"op": "replace", "segment": 15, "text": "The Receiving Party may develop, acquire or market products or services similar to those of the Disclosing Party, provided that it does not use or disclose any Confidential Information in doing so.", "fixes": "S-023"}]}
